        name = "Argent Crusader's Tabard",
        stepCount = 8,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Champion all five cities, earn their required Exalted reputations and buy the Crusader teleport tabard.\n\n1. First check Dame Evniki Kapsalis inside the Argent pavilion in Icecrown (69.5, 23.2). If your account already earned Crusader, inspect her inventory on this character before repeating all five championships. If accessible, go straight to earning the 50 seals in step 6.\n\n2. Without a Crusader unlock, begin at Justicar Mariel Trueheart (69.6, 22.8). Complete mounted lessons, collect 15 Aspirant's Seals for Up to the Challenge, then win The Aspirant's Challenge. Advance your first city's 25-Valiant's-Seal charge, win The Valiant's Challenge and finish A Champion Rises.\n\n3. Champion all FIVE original cities of your faction, one city at a time. Alliance: Stormwind, Ironforge, Gnomeregan, Darnassus and Exodar. Horde: Orgrimmar, Sen'jin/Darkspear, Undercity, Thunder Bluff and Silvermoon. Each additional city's charge needs 25 Valiant's Seals and its challenge. Continue Champion dailies alongside the current city's training.\n\n4. Reach Exalted with those same five city reputations. City quests and Champion's Writ hand-ins help; for a repeatable dungeon route, equip the appropriate city tabard and clear Normal Botanica in Netherstorm (71.7, 54.9), exit behind the last boss, reset and repeat. Change the actual tabard when changing the city reputation being farmed.\n\n5. Also reach Argent Crusade Exalted. Buy its separate Friendly tabard from Aliocha Segard at the Argent Vanguard (87.6, 75.6 in Icecrown), equip it and run eligible Wrath heroics such as Halls of Lightning (45.4, 21.4 in the Storm Peaks). Check 2817/2816 for all city championships, city Exalted achievements and Argent Crusade Exalted. This awards Crusader; the unrelated Argent Champion title does not.\n\n6. Earn and save 50 Champion's Seals on the purchasing character. Do its unlocked Champion dailies, open their purses and complete the Black Knight investigation for Threat From Above. Daily Heroic Trial of the Champion at 75.1, 21.8 adds seals. Aspirant's and Valiant's Seals are not purchase currency.\n\n7. Return to Dame Evniki Kapsalis (69.5, 23.2) and buy Argent Crusader's Tabard for 50 Champion's Seals. Browse all pages if necessary; the tabard is available to non-Paladins too.\n\n8. Equip the physical tabard and use it to teleport to the Argent pavilion. You can transmog its appearance, but keep the real item for the teleport. It brings you to the tournament in northern Icecrown, not Dalaran or the Argent Vanguard.",
